// PARAM: --analysis interval
// The contrasting baseline for 06-sequential_global_proved.vimp: the same
// x := 0; x := 1; check(x == 1) sequence, but x is an ordinary local.
// Tracked flow-sensitively per program point, so the second write's exact
// value reaches the check with no join against the first -- identical
// result to the global version, since no call ever crosses x in either.
void main() {
  x := 0;
  x := 1;
  __voblint_check(x == 1) // PROVED
}
